{%- comment -%}
  ECOMS · «Compra verificada» label for a real review.

  The ecoms_review metaobject carries an optional «source» text field naming where the purchase
  happened (e.g. «Mercado Libre»). When it has a value the claim says where it can be checked;
  otherwise it stays as it was. Renders nothing when the review is not marked as verified, so an
  unverified review never gains a badge it did not have.

  Accepts:
  - verified: {Boolean} the review is a verified purchase
  - source: {String} optional, where the purchase was made
  - short: {Boolean} optional, compact wording for tight badges («Verificada en X»)
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- if verified -%}
  {%- assign rv_source = source | strip -%}
  {%- if short -%}
    {%- if rv_source != blank -%}Verificada en {{ rv_source | escape }}{%- else -%}Verificada{%- endif -%}
  {%- else -%}
    {%- if rv_source != blank -%}Compra verificada en {{ rv_source | escape }}{%- else -%}Compra verificada{%- endif -%}
  {%- endif -%}
{%- endif -%}
